# Machines
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Press.name=Rune Press Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Press.description=Used to shape raw materials into empty runes.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Imbuer.name=Imbuer Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Imbuer.description=Used to imbue empty runes with elemental essence.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Mana_Liquifier.name=Mana Liquifier Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Mana_Liquifier.description=Used to convert elemental essences into liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color> using fuel.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#00D4D5">output</color>.

# Vanilla Machines
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Alchemy.name=Alchemy Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Alchemy.description=Used to create potions and elixirs.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.\n\n<i>The alchemists of old long sought the secrets to eternal life. Some might say they achieved that grand goal, though perhaps not in the form they imagined.</i>
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Arcane.name=Arcane Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Arcane.description=Used to fashion various arcane implements.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.\n\n<i>The arcane arts are the closest mere mortals have ever come to achieving Avatar powers. Had they mastered them sooner, perhaps they would not have been so easily swayed.</i>
## Architects?
## Armory?
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Armour.name=Armour Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Armour.description=Used to craft basic armor.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
## Builders?
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Furniture.name=Furniture Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Furniture.description=Used to craft furniture, storage, and decorative items to personalize your home.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Campfire.name=Campfire Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Campfire.description=Cook basic meals.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.\n\n<i>To many an adventurer, the humble campfire is all it takes to declare a place "home." Unshakeable bonds can be forged while basking in its warmth and all great tales have sparked from its embers.</i>
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Cooking.name=Cooking Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Cooking.description=A built-in kitchen that can be used to make advanced dishes.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Farming.name=Farming Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Farming.description=Used to craft farming accessories and animal feed.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Furnace.name=Furnace Machine
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Machine_Furnace.description=Used to process ore into metal bars.\nUpgrading reduces smelting times and increases storage capacity.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
